---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="TikTok Shop // neøflow Oficial TikTok Partners"
  description="Conheça a conexão oficial da neøflow para sellers autorizarem sua operação no TikTok Shop."
>
  <main class="shop-page">
    <div class="shop-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="shop-container">
      <!-- Breadcrumb / Back -->
      <a class="back-link font-mono" href="/">← TODAS AS ENTRADAS</a>

      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <header class="shop-hero">
        <div class="kicker-pill font-mono">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
          01 — SHOP // OFICIAL TIKTOK PARTNERS
        </div>
        <p class="tagline font-mono">Seu perfil. Seus interesses. Nosso negócio.</p>
        <h1 class="font-display">Conecte sua operação ao TikTok Shop.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
          Comece pela autorização oficial da sua loja e conceda somente os escopos necessários para identificação, vínculo e consulta operacional.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-sublead">
          A <strong>neøflow</strong> prepara a conexão por APIs oficiais do TikTok Shop sem solicitar sua senha, tokens ou identificadores internos.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary font-mono" href="/sellers/conectar">
            INICIAR CONEXÃO DA LOJA <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn-secondary font-mono" href="mailto:neo@neotiktok.com">
            FALAR COM ESPECIALISTA <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- 4 Superpowers / 4 Pilares -->
      <section class="pillars-section" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
        <div class="section-badge font-mono">CONEXÃO SELLER</div>
        <h2 id="pillars-title" class="font-display">O que esta etapa habilita</h2>

        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <!-- Pilar 1 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">01</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">OAUTH SELLER</span>
              <h3>Autorização oficial da loja</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">A conexão começa no consentimento seguro do TikTok Shop.</p>
            <ul class="pillar-details">
              <li>
                <strong>Sem compartilhar senha:</strong> a autorização acontece no ambiente oficial do TikTok Shop.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Consentimento explícito:</strong> o seller visualiza e aprova os escopos solicitados.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <!-- Pilar 2 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">02</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">ESCOPO MÍNIMO</span>
              <h3>Dados estritamente necessários</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">A etapa atual se limita à conexão e à leitura operacional autorizada.</p>
            <ul class="pillar-details">
              <li>
                <strong>Informações da loja:</strong> identificação e dados operacionais básicos do seller.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Informações de pedidos:</strong> consulta somente quando o seller autorizar esse acesso.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <!-- Pilar 3 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">03</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">SEGURANÇA</span>
              <h3>Proteção do fluxo de autorização</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">O gateway protege o início e o retorno do OAuth.</p>
            <ul class="pillar-details">
              <li>
                <strong>Proteção anti-CSRF:</strong> state de uso único e vínculo com a sessão do navegador.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Credenciais protegidas:</strong> tokens e identificadores sensíveis permanecem no backend.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>

          <!-- Pilar 4 -->
          <article class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-number font-mono">04</div>
            <div class="pillar-header">
              <span class="pillar-tag font-mono">PRÓXIMA ETAPA</span>
              <h3>Diagnóstico da operação</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="pillar-summary">A autorização estabelece a base técnica para avaliar a operação real.</p>
            <ul class="pillar-details">
              <li>
                <strong>Capacidades sob demanda:</strong> novas permissões dependem da necessidade e do consentimento do seller.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Sem promessa financeira:</strong> esta conexão não representa cobrança, checkout, split ou garantia de receita.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Manifesto Box -->
      <section class="manifesto-card" aria-label="Manifesto neøflow">
        <p class="manifesto-kicker font-mono">NOSSO MANIFESTO DE ATITUDE</p>
        <blockquote class="manifesto-quote font-display">
          <p>“Não é programa de afiliados.”</p>
          <p>“Não é prestação de serviços.”</p>
          <p>“Não é marketing digital.”</p>
          <p class="manifesto-highlight">“É apenas o que gostamos de fazer.”</p>
        </blockquote>
      </section>

      <!-- Integration CTA Section -->
      <section class="integration-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
        <div class="status-badge font-mono">
          <span class="status-live-dot"></span>
          STATUS DO SISTEMA: PRONTO PARA INTEGRAÇÃO
        </div>
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="font-display">Pronto para iniciar a autorização da sua loja?</h2>
        <p class="cta-desc">
          Inicie agora a conexão oficial com validação anti-CSRF e autorização de escopos oficiais TikTok Shop Brasil.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn-cta font-mono" href="/sellers/conectar">
            INICIAR CONEXÃO DA LOJA <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <span class="security-stamp font-mono">
            🔒 TikTok Partner Verificado · Enterprise Business Center ID 7614619530886840336
          </span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .shop-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: calc(7rem + var(--sat)) 1.25rem 5rem;
  }

  .shop-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10rem;
    right: -10rem;
    width: 48rem;
    height: 48rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.16) 0%, rgba(9, 19, 26, 0) 70%);
    filter: blur(40px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .shop-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4.5rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    transform: translateX(-3px);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .shop-hero {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .kicker-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3);
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--neo-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neo-coral);
  }

  .tagline {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .shop-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 840px;
  }

  .hero-lead strong {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
  }

  .hero-sublead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--neo-coral);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.45);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    color: var(--neo-white);
    padding: 1.1rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  /* Blueprint Showcase Section */
  .blueprint-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .blueprint-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .blueprint-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .blueprint-desc {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .image-showcase-wrapper {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .blueprint-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .blueprint-caption {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(9, 19, 26, 0.85);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* Pillars Section */
  .pillars-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-badge {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .pillars-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    margin-top: -1.5rem;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    position: relative;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .pillar-number {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .pillar-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .pillar-tag {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .pillar-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .pillar-summary {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .pillar-details {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .pillar-details li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .pillar-details strong {
    color: var(--neo-white);
  }

  /* Payments Showcase */
  .payments-showcase-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    padding-top: 4rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .payments-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .payments-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--neo-white);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .payments-lead {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .payments-points {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .payments-points li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .point-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    min-width: 90px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .payments-image-box {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    max-height: 520px;
  }

  .payments-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-height: 520px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Manifesto Card */
  .manifesto-card {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.08) 0%, rgba(18, 18, 20, 0.9) 80%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .manifesto-kicker {
    color: var(--neo-coral);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .manifesto-quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .manifesto-highlight {
    color: var(--neo-white) !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .integration-cta {
    background: var(--neo-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--neo-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    align-items: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .status-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #4ade80;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.25);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .status-live-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #4ade80;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #4ade80;
  }

  .integration-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.85rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    max-width: 760px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .cta-desc {
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 620px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-cta {
    background: var(--neo-coral);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(254, 44, 85, 0.55);
  }

  .security-stamp {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--neo-text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 840px) {
    .pillars-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .payments-showcase-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .payments-image-box {
      max-height: 400px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .btn-cta {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
